From 71c74f276e7ef0662d90ad462794a5ca018e7d1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:03:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v0.8.6: field of view, debug menu notes, wording, VU1 input
 formats

keys.ini field_of_view (80-150 % of the game's), in Settings > Picture and the
Options list: written to the camera's zoom factor (PS2_CAMERA_ZOOM) while the
game's own zoom is idle. The Options list shows FXAA. The filter's menu name
in sentence case. The debug menu's hint and notes (it answers Cross with the
pnach section of v0.8.6; the longer developers' menu is only a table).
PS2_VU1_STATS also prints the UNPACKs each program is given most often.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
